---
// How a drawing is read: a dark band with one control panel drawing,
// exploded into the five steps Spyke takes. The base sheet is the scan as it arrives; each layer above it is a see-through
// overlay showing only what that step adds: straightened, ruled lines
// traced, parts list found, read twice and checked, as in backend/extraction
// in the app. The build-up animation is in global.css, with a script below
// for browsers that can't link an animation to the scroll.
